WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:04.380
Hey guys,
Are you addicted to something right now?&nbsp;

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.680
I challenge you to be honest with yourself.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.500
You might be addicted to something&nbsp;
and you don't even realize it.&nbsp;

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.040
So how do you know?
Well, you test yourself.&nbsp;

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.840
I want you to answer these&nbsp;
questions and answer them honestly.&nbsp;

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.780
Number one -
Do you crave this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:34.080
thing every week or even every day, meaning&nbsp;
you feel that you can never get enough of it?&nbsp;

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.800
You always want to do it again?
Two -&nbsp;

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.520
Do you get irritated or&nbsp;
anxious when you can't do it?&nbsp;

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.700
Three -
Does it feel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:52.740
like you need to do this thing in order to satisfy&nbsp;
your craving to feel better and more in control?&nbsp;

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.860
Four -
Is this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.860 --> 00:01:00.660
thing disrupting your friendships&nbsp;
or even your normal daily routine?&nbsp;

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:04.680
Five -
Do you tell yourself you won't do it again&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:10.800
but then you turn around and you do the&nbsp;
exact same thing over and over again?&nbsp;

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:17.280
Now if you answered yes to most of these questions&nbsp;
then you are probably addicted to something,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.760
especially if you answered&nbsp;
yes to the last question.&nbsp;

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:27.060
You see, addiction comes from sin.
It comes from your sinful flesh.&nbsp;

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:31.260
It can get so strong that&nbsp;
it overpowers your own will.&nbsp;

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:34.920
It is only God's spirit that&nbsp;
can help you to overcome it.&nbsp;

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:42.600
Listen to Romans 7:15...
[Romans 7:15]

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:52.020
You know, Christians can&nbsp;
especially feel bad about this.&nbsp;

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:55.680
And even doubt their own salvation,&nbsp;
because they've been trying to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:01.080
overcome this through the soul level.
Their own will, own emotions, own intellect.&nbsp;

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:08.580
And they haven't been fighting through the Spirit.
So changing from the soul level to the spiritual&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:14.220
level - fighting it through that - is the&nbsp;
key to overcome any sin and addiction.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.500
[Romans 7:17-23]

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:56.220
You see, you are not the only&nbsp;
person who struggles with this.&nbsp;

00:02:56.220 --> 00:03:02.340
Paul wrote about this 2,000 years ago, already.
And you need to understand that this sinful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:09.000
condition in us human beings, it is a disease,&nbsp;
and you need to admit this about yourself first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:14.040
before you can overcome it.
Because the truth will set you free.&nbsp;

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:15.900
He says in Verse 21:

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.040
[Romans 7:21]

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:47.880
You see, it's - you need to understand&nbsp;
this - it's a waging war in your mind.&nbsp;

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:52.920
Making you captive.
You see, sin is poison.&nbsp;

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:58.320
And if you just leave it, it&nbsp;
leads and grows into addiction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.980
like pornography.
Jesus said:

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.080
[Matthew 5:27- 29]

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:36.240
So let's go with this example of pornography.
Watching porn is a sin.&nbsp;

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:42.240
God is very serious and very direct about this.
And it can turn into addiction.&nbsp;

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.720
It works like this: You watch a little bit,&nbsp;
and then a little bit more, a little bit more,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:49.320
before you know it doing this&nbsp;
sin - this sin starts to grow.&nbsp;

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:53.880
It takes root in your mind.
More roots, roots, roots.&nbsp;

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:56.460
And it grows.
It's living in your mind.&nbsp;

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:02.160
It creates pathways like the roots of a tree.
The more you do it, the more it grows.&nbsp;

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:07.380
Actions grow into habits, then it grows so&nbsp;
much that it becomes part of your routine.&nbsp;

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:11.100
It is evil growing within&nbsp;
you, becoming an addiction.&nbsp;

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:15.120
And that is what is so important&nbsp;
for people to stop sin before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:19.920
it starts to take root in your life.
And people who struggle with a certain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:24.660
addiction for a long time, that have many&nbsp;
roots, many pathways already in their brain.&nbsp;

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:31.020
So all those pathways in your mind - it&nbsp;
disrupts your normal life, your relationships,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:37.200
and every small root is like an impulse&nbsp;
that makes you want to do that addiction.&nbsp;

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:42.180
For example, the moment you see a girl&nbsp;
in a bikini on Facebook or Instagram&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:46.080
or even in a TV show, it immediately&nbsp;
makes you think about watching porn.&nbsp;

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:50.580
Now, a lot of people think that they can still&nbsp;
overcome it, when it is even this strong.&nbsp;

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:55.380
They can still overcome it with&nbsp;
their own power, their own willpower.&nbsp;

00:05:56.160 --> 00:06:02.700
If you think that, I need to tell you this.
You have already lost the battle.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:09.960
If you don't change right now - because&nbsp;
you cannot overcome it by yourself.&nbsp;

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:17.460
Because yourself is already wretched -&nbsp;
it has that sinful flesh in you already.&nbsp;

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:19.620
Paul says in Verse 24:

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:21.480
[Romans 5:24]

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:29.820
You see, now Paul is on the right track,&nbsp;
because he's saying, man, I am righteous.&nbsp;

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:33.840
He understands that and now, he's&nbsp;
looking outside of himself and asking,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:36.840
who can deliver me From myself?

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:40.800
And then in Verse 25 we see the answer:

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.260
[Romans 7:25]

00:06:56.820 --> 00:07:00.000
And directly in the next chapter,&nbsp;
he continues and he says:

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.260
[Romans 8:1-4]

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:41.280
And here it comes.
Listen closely.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:44.700
[Romans 8:34]

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.960
You see, that is part of the&nbsp;
reason why Jesus came to Earth.&nbsp;

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:59.220
To set us free from our sin.
To give us the Holy Spirit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:05.880
when we accept Him as Lord and Savior.
So that we have the power we need to overcome sin.&nbsp;

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.760
And that includes addiction.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.260
Jesus said:

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.600
[John 8:34-36]

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:38.460
So how do we fight with the&nbsp;
Spirit in us- against sin?&nbsp;

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:42.720
Well, let's continue to read and&nbsp;
the answer will become clear.

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.860
[Romans 8:5]

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:59.220
So you need to set your mind&nbsp;
on the things of the Spirit.&nbsp;

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:06.120
You need to study the Word of God and you need&nbsp;
to let the Holy Spirit change your mind to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.820
thinking about the things of the Spirit.
Let's continue.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:10.680
[Romans 8:6-7]

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:37.620
You see, when you want to overcome sin and&nbsp;
addiction through the flesh, you cannot do it.&nbsp;

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:39.540
It is impossible.

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:41.280
[Romans 8:8]

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:52.260
You see, this is why people who battle addiction&nbsp;
like, for example, alcohol - when they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:57.420
so tired of their addiction - regretting the&nbsp;
destruction it brought on their lives - they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.420 --> 00:10:02.700
look to God repent of their sins.
And they accept Christ into their life.&nbsp;

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.780
Then in a lot of cases they are&nbsp;
freed from their addiction as well.&nbsp;

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:12.360
We know that in psychology converting&nbsp;
to Christianity is a proven treatment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:15.960
that works for people who are&nbsp;
addicted to alcohol, for example.&nbsp;

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:19.500
That is according to how they&nbsp;
see it - a proven treatment.&nbsp;

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:24.960
But we know the reality of it.
We know it is God that comes and changes a person.&nbsp;

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:28.200
They are ... sick and tired&nbsp;
of their old lifestyle.&nbsp;

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:32.220
Being addicted to alcohol, and the&nbsp;
destruction it caused in their lives.&nbsp;

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:34.860
And they reach out to God&nbsp;
and they say, God help me.&nbsp;

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:40.320
Make me free.
Save me from all the things that I've done.&nbsp;

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:41.580
I'm sorry.
I repent.&nbsp;

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:46.560
And I accept you as Lord and Savior.
Come and make me a new person and God does it.&nbsp;

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:51.660
He gives His Spirit that comes&nbsp;
and lives inside of them.&nbsp;

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:55.560
Helping them to overcome that addiction.
And they are freed.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:57.180
[Romans 8:9]

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:11.940
Meaning if you truly are a reborn&nbsp;
Christian, God's Spirit is in you.&nbsp;

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:15.060
There are many people who say that&nbsp;
they are Christians, but they are not.&nbsp;

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:19.380
They're just practicing dead man's religion.&nbsp;

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:22.320
They have never been reborn.
Spiritually reborn.&nbsp;

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.480
And this is what he's talking about.
Let's continue.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.820
[Romans 8:9-11]

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:07.560
Wow, so first you need to learn how to fight&nbsp;
through the Spirit, through God's power in you.&nbsp;

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:11.820
Not through your own flesh, your own will.
Your own emotions, your own intellect,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:15.120
making your plans .... I've got to do this&nbsp;
and this... is trying to fight it on your own.&nbsp;

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:18.900
Because you will not be victorious.
You need to do it for God's spirit.&nbsp;

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:25.620
And where you start is here.
Go and clean everything inside of you.&nbsp;

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:31.680
Go and repent of all the sin that you have done.
Ask God to forgive you.&nbsp;

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:35.460
A purification needs to be done.

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.140
[1 John 1:9]

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.360
So God cleans you.
He washes you clean.&nbsp;

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:57.300
Because of His blood.
He died for your sins.&nbsp;

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:58.560
On the cross.
You accepted.&nbsp;

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:05.220
You're asking God - sorry that I drank so much -&nbsp;
sorry that I watch pornography - sorry that I've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:08.640
let it take root in my life.
You go and you be specific.&nbsp;

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:17.220
You ask him, Father, reveal to me through the&nbsp;
Holy Spirit what do you want me to confess.&nbsp;

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:22.740
Bring to my mind everything that is&nbsp;
wrong, that is in the way of me and You,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:27.120
to walk forward in righteousness.
And then you will see.&nbsp;

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:31.380
Now you remember this and then&nbsp;
you ask God to forgive this.&nbsp;

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:36.720
And then next is another thing, another&nbsp;
thing, another thing, you continue to do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:39.600
that until there is nothing.
Until you are clean.&nbsp;

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:46.560
And then you move forward.
You trust His word that says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:50.460
that if you ask Him for forgiveness He will&nbsp;
forgive you. You don't go by our feelings.&nbsp;

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.280
You leave the past.&nbsp;

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:55.980
Because now you've sorted it out.
You never have to think about it again.&nbsp;

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:58.680
It is done.
God declared you as righteous.&nbsp;

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:06.240
He forgave you because His word says it.
So now you also need to forgive yourself.&nbsp;

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:12.900
Remember you live now according to the&nbsp;
Spirit, not according to the flesh anymore.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:18.000
And you also need to go back and ask&nbsp;
forgiveness to those that you have hurt.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.080
Everything you do now needs&nbsp;
to be done through the Spirit.

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.200
[Galatians 5:16-24]

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.460
Do you see?&nbsp;

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:10.980
Jesus did not just die on the cross for you.
He wasn't just crucified for our sins.&nbsp;

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:16.920
When you accepted Him, you decided to&nbsp;
turn away from your old sinful lifestyle.&nbsp;

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:22.380
That old sinful lifestyle&nbsp;
was crucified with Jesus.&nbsp;

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:27.720
That's what it means, when you're baptized, you&nbsp;
died, your old self under the water, when you come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:33.840
up, it symbolizes your new life in Jesus Christ.
Read this with me again.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.060
[Galatians 5:24-25]

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:50.940
So, how do you keep in step with the Holy Spirit?&nbsp;

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:54.420
Well, first you need to educate yourself.
You need to renew your mind.&nbsp;

00:16:55.380 --> 00:17:00.120
So you need to read scripture, the Logos,&nbsp;
and then as you read it, let the Holy Spirit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:03.960
guide you through the Rhema word.
To talk to you through scripture.&nbsp;

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:08.460
The church - your brothers and sisters&nbsp;
in Christ - as you grow spiritually.&nbsp;

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:13.440
This is so important.
You need to grow into a mature Christian.&nbsp;

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:20.640
Because over time, you'll become stronger so that&nbsp;
you can handle the sin in your life a lot better.&nbsp;

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.640
You need to live in the truth.
In the Spirit.&nbsp;

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:27.600
You need to live it, act it,&nbsp;
breathe it, write it on your heart.&nbsp;

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:31.740
You need to obey it.
And over time you will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:38.040
grow spiritually stronger with the armor&nbsp;
of God that you need to put on daily.&nbsp;

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:44.700
You see, God is amazing.
He doesn't leave us alone to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:47.520
through these things by ourselves.
Because we cannot.&nbsp;

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:51.720
He is there with you.
He will help you to grow spiritually, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:59.220
it is your responsibility to make time for God.
Remember, new Christians, especially, they look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:02.460
like spiritual babies.
It doesn't look good.&nbsp;

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:05.640
You know, imagine a grown-up&nbsp;
man walking around in a diaper.&nbsp;

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:09.540
It doesn't look good.
You know, it's not supposed to be that way.&nbsp;

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:14.700
There are many people who claim to be Christians&nbsp;
for years but they are still spiritual babies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:19.380
and so they will always struggle.
You don't want to stay like that.&nbsp;

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:22.140
A spiritual baby.
You want to grow.

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:24.180
[1 Corinthians 3:1-3]

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:51.240
There are still a lot of people out there -&nbsp;
there are a lot of lukewarm Christians - who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.820
are not really Christians at all.
But then there are a lot of Christians&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.940
who just sit at home on their&nbsp;
couches in their comfort positions.&nbsp;

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:59.700
They don't grow spiritually.
They are kind of stuck.&nbsp;

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:05.580
And it is so sad to see that&nbsp;
he couldn't stay like that.&nbsp;

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:10.260
Do not be like those people.
Grow in the Word.&nbsp;

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:13.620
Grow in truth.
Become spiritually mature.&nbsp;

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:17.940
When you read the Bible, don't&nbsp;
just let it be informative.&nbsp;

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:25.140
You need to act, change over&nbsp;
to being obedient to the Word.&nbsp;

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.960
You know, when you read the Bible, don't&nbsp;
just read and say, oh this is interesting.&nbsp;

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:30.060
This is interesting.
No, read it in this way.&nbsp;

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:33.960
Oh the Bible says I have to do&nbsp;
this - I have to do this - okay,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:38.340
how am I going to apply this in my life?
Am I doing this?&nbsp;

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:43.740
How do you read the Bible or do you just read&nbsp;
it and it tells you - oh I need to tell Susan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:49.920
this I need to tell John about this.
No, the Bible is talking to you.&nbsp;

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:55.260
God needs to be your first priority&nbsp;
and to study the Word and listen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:55.260 --> 00:20:00.600
to the Holy Spirit and obey Him.
You will always have a will on your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:04.800
soul level and this is where God gives&nbsp;
you the freedom to choose how to live.&nbsp;

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:09.060
But you need to choose to&nbsp;
always let the Spirit guide you.&nbsp;

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:11.220
Let me explain it to you in a&nbsp;
way that you can understand.&nbsp;

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:17.520
If you go to the bathroom,&nbsp;
the tap - the water is there.&nbsp;

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.920
It's available.
But you need to open it.&nbsp;

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:25.800
And it's the same way you need to open yourself&nbsp;
so that the Holy Spirit can flow through you.&nbsp;

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:32.400
If you do that, if you allow the Holy Spirit to&nbsp;
guide you, your own emotions - your will - your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:37.140
intellect - man, it's amazing.
Because He moves in righteousness,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:42.960
in truth, and then you come along and your&nbsp;
emotions, your will, your personality,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:46.740
your attitude.... starts to change.
It becomes more like Christ.&nbsp;

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:50.820
Your mind is renewed.
It's beautiful.&nbsp;

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:54.960
And if you do that, you will always&nbsp;
produce the fruit of the spirit:

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:09.300
According to Galatians 5, and this is&nbsp;
important, because self-control - you need&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:13.860
to have self-control - to do what?
To overcome sin and addiction.&nbsp;

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:18.180
Remember, God also says that He&nbsp;
has not given us a spirit of fear.&nbsp;

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:22.080
Don't fear this addiction or trying to fight it.
Now with the Spirit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:26.280
you have to tackle it by the horns.
God has not given us a spirit of fear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:31.500
but a spirit of power, love, and self-control.&nbsp;

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:39.000
You need to act in this truth so you have the&nbsp;
power through Christ to overcome addiction.&nbsp;

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:45.240
Now you just need to access this power every day.
Put on the armor of God and fight it.&nbsp;

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:49.320
Because it is going to be a battle every day.
You're gonna need to battle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:54.060
your own fleshly desires.
But also sometimes the devil and his demons.

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:55.320
[1 Peter 5:8]

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:10.080
For some reason, there are a lot of&nbsp;
Christians who are scared of the devil.&nbsp;

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:14.100
I don't understand why.
Because Jesus Christ already won on the cross.&nbsp;

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:17.160
He's victorious.
You are victorious through Jesus Christ,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:23.820
meaning you have the authority to rebuke&nbsp;
the devil, to resist him, and he will flee.&nbsp;

