You need to walk in this truth.
In boldness.&nbsp;

00:22:29.040 --> 00:22:36.360
You pray for protection, you walk in this&nbsp;
truth, and the devil stands no chance.

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:38.520
[James 4:7]

